 {tag:'RI.4.8 Evidence',q:`Which detail best supports the idea that octopuses are smart?`,a:`They solve puzzles and open jars.`,w:[`They have blue blood.`,`They have eight arms.`,`They live in the sea.`],ev:[`solve puzzles`],clue:`Which detail shows thinking?`,why:`Solving puzzles shows intelligence.`},
 {tag:'RI.4.2 Main idea',q:`What is the main idea?`,a:`Octopuses have amazing bodies and are clever problem-solvers.`,w:[`Octopuses live one or two years.`,`Coconuts float in the ocean.`,`Aquariums need better lids.`],ev:null,clue:`Which choice covers the whole text?`,why:`The text is about their bodies and their brains.`}
